    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=720 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.mp4?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game about a troubled mind succumbing to the calls of the void.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it endure it's last stand against The Gray? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the troubled depths of human psyche with caution. Sometimes the most perilous adversary of the mind is its own consciousness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your way of dealing with the troubled mind adversaries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide, distract or fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/d851f17a1d7902e5428f45b84aaa8243.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/d851f17a1d7902e5428f45b84aaa8243.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/d851f17a1d7902e5428f45b84aaa8243.mp4?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/767c23b49fb705236f44e04a517a4788.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seek the way down.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/3683d1daa7dc292ce4fefbf69bb13aef.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the twisted environment to your advantage. Seek refuge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a simple stone can save your life. Throw it to redirect unwanted interest of other well dwellers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when cornered... fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths to find clues, overcome obstacles and solve puzzles to unravel the mysteries of the well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwell</strong> is an isometric survival horror game with a narrative inspired by the psychological theory of personality by Sigmund Freud and The Map Of Consciousness by David R. Hawkins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.mp4?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=189 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwell is a story that hits close to home, experienced in a twisted way. The themes manifested in the game will concern each and every one of us. Sooner or later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one way or another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember - The Great Dig was a lie.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=720 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/6fa55b718876e6244a948a120f73c4dd.mp4?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/06b3d2db80bb6acf2a12e619e46f230b.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game about a troubled mind succumbing to the calls of the void.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it endure it's last stand against The Gray? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the troubled depths of human psyche with caution. Sometimes the most perilous adversary of the mind is its own consciousness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your way of dealing with the troubled mind adversaries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide, distract or fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/d851f17a1d7902e5428f45b84aaa8243.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=600 height=3