117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/1cf380117386bf45f9665bf330b23c16.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths to find clues, overcome obstacles and solve puzzles to unravel the mysteries of the well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/add2c6ba8881559c4a7092bf0a123861.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwell</strong> is an isometric survival horror game with a narrative inspired by the psychological theory of personality by Sigmund Freud and The Map Of Consciousness by David R. Hawkins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/a12586cfc5c99cd86e0a191c1eabce1b.mp4?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=189 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/625701d30ca7105150000ed16c8296ef.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwell is a story that hits close to home, experienced in a twisted way. The themes manifested in the game will concern each and every one of us. Sooner or later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one way or another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.poster.avif?t=1747554409\" width=620 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662070/extras/56496c1365adc1e04520e2d0deab4f43.webm?t=1747554409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember - The Great Dig was a lie.</p>",
    "short_description": "You regain consciousness. Beside you lies a broken and rusted ladder, and in front of you stretches a dark, damp-smelling corridor. In the distance, you hear the sound of falling water. You have no idea where you are. All you know is that you must go deeper.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThere is an atmosphere so thick in the Unwell game that I felt my hair stand up on end. The strangest thing is that I have been bald for fifteen years. There is something to look forward to!\u201d<br>Wulgarny Gracz<br><br>\u201cThe atmosphere is so thick you could cut it with a knife. Horror and isometric perspective play so well in Unwell that they\u2019ll raise anyone\u2019s blood pressure!\u201d<br>GraLiq<br><br>\u201cThe cryptic story and dark aura combine to create a unique, intriguing, and peculiar (in a good way) experience.\u201d<br>Pan Dibbler<br>",
